+ * Picks one random item. Every position is equally likely. The input is not changed.
+ * @template T
+ * @param {T[]} xs
+ * @param {() => number} [rng] returns a number from 0 up to, but not including, 1, like Math.random (the default)
+ * @returns {T | undefined} the item, or undefined for an empty array (rng is not called then)
+ * @throws {TypeError} if xs is not an array or rng is not a function
+ * @throws {RangeError} if rng returns something other than a number from 0 up to, but not including, 1
+ */
