+ * where it is already Sunday. The local time zone makes no difference.
+ * @param {Date} date a valid Date
+ * @returns {boolean} e.g. isWeekend(new Date('2024-03-09T12:00:00Z')) is true (a Saturday)
+ * @throws {TypeError} if date is not a Date
+ * @throws {RangeError} if date is an invalid Date
