+ * without overflowing: the mean of [Number.MAX_VALUE, Number.MAX_VALUE] is Number.MAX_VALUE (when the sum is too big
+ * for a number the result can be one rounding step off). NaN items give NaN,
+ * and infinite items give an infinite mean (or NaN if both Infinity and -Infinity are present).
