+/**
+ * Converts a whole number from 1 to 3999 to a Roman numeral in the standard form, with subtractive pairs:
+ * 4 is "IV", not "IIII". There is no zero, no negative numbers, and nothing above 3999 (MMMCMXCIX).
+ * @param {number} n
+ * @returns {string} e.g. toRoman(1994) gives "MCMXCIV"
